posts.body:
It appears to be specific and intentional that star passability tiles are not taken into account for passability, regardless of the direction settings. See from Game_Map.checkPassage():
I haven't set up tiles and tested this in a game, but you may get the effect you want by simply removing that check.
Paste the below into a text editor, save as a *.js file, include as a plugin:
Code:
Game_Map.prototype.checkPassage = function(x, y, bit) {
    const flags = this.tilesetFlags();
    const tiles = this.allTiles(x, y);
    for (const tile of tiles) {
        const flag = flags[tile];
        if ((flag & bit) === 0) {
            // [o] Passable
            return true;
        }
        if ((flag & bit) === bit) {
            // [x] Impassable
            return false;
        }
    }
    return false;
};
